Wretched beast protected by
the loathsome army,

271
00:20:41.907 --> 00:20:43.309
show yourself!

272
00:21:02.628 --> 00:21:05.330
I am Baphomet!

273
00:21:05.397 --> 00:21:09.201
I came here to take you
pathetic beings to hell!

274
00:21:09.268 --> 00:21:11.570
Your plan has completely failed,
Baphomet!

275
00:21:11.637 --> 00:21:12.905
Only torment will...

276
00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:18.944
Why did this ignorant Yankee
come all the way here?

277
00:21:26.352 --> 00:21:27.886
In the name of the father,

278
00:21:27.953 --> 00:21:31.123
and of the son,
and of the holy spirit!

279
00:21:31.190 --> 00:21:34.593
I order you, Baphomet,
be gone from this land!

280
00:21:44.069 --> 00:21:48.240
Villagers called the ghost
that haunted the girl

281
00:21:48.307 --> 00:21:49.942
"Demonic Goat" from that day on.

282
00:21:50.943 --> 00:21:53.546
I'm sure
she wasn't really haunted.

283
00:21:55.714 --> 00:21:57.817
I don't believe it myself,

284
00:21:58.384 --> 00:22:03.222
but I heard my great-uncle
passed away because of her.

285
00:22:04.056 --> 00:22:04.890
Sister...

286
00:22:04.957 --> 00:22:06.659
Don't move, Yohan!

287
00:22:18.070 --> 00:22:20.306
(Lee Won-Hee (1932-1956)
(Sung-bin's Great-uncle)

288
00:22:23.242 --> 00:22:26.378
Dang, so what happened
to the Demonic Goat?

289
00:22:26.979 --> 00:22:27.979
What happened was…

290
00:22:29.281 --> 00:22:33.252
Dumb humans, I will burn
you all in hell fire!

291
00:22:34.854 --> 00:22:38.257
Hot, so hot!

292
00:22:38.324 --> 00:22:40.659
So damn hot! Burning!

293
00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:02.848
Excuse me, sir?

294
00:23:02.915 --> 00:23:04.250
Shut up!

295
00:23:07.319 --> 00:23:09.889
So he fired a silver bullet
to her head.

296
00:23:10.389 --> 00:23:11.389
Oh no...

297
00:23:12.358 --> 00:23:14.393
For this reason,

298
00:23:15.227 --> 00:23:19.064
my grandfather makes me
carry a talisman.

299
00:23:19.899 --> 00:23:20.899
Here.

300
00:23:22.534 --> 00:23:25.471
He bought it from
a good shaman for $10,000.

301
00:23:27.539 --> 00:23:29.041
This is $10,000?

302
00:23:29.475 --> 00:23:31.510
- Sure.
- Wow...

303
00:23:34.713 --> 00:23:37.983
I sold the property as you asked,
I hope there's no problem.

304
00:23:38.550 --> 00:23:40.230
That place has so many
terrifying rumors...

305
00:23:40.519 --> 00:23:42.588
Those are just old rumors.

306
00:23:43.222 --> 00:23:44.590
Don't worry.

307
00:23:44.657 --> 00:23:47.759
Anyway, I need to go away
for a while.

308
00:23:47.826 --> 00:23:49.328
What for?

309
00:23:49.395 --> 00:23:52.131
With so many defects,
if more problems surface,

310
00:23:52.831 --> 00:23:55.100
those guys might really kill me.

311
00:23:55.167 --> 00:23:56.669
Kill you?

312
00:23:57.236 --> 00:23:59.137
Was there a problem
during the signing?

313
00:23:59.204 --> 00:24:01.340
Sister, don't even think about
meeting them.

314
00:24:01.407 --> 00:24:02.775
What kind of people were they?

315
00:24:03.909 --> 00:24:05.844
They lifted me up
and spun me around!

316
00:24:20.793 --> 00:24:24.029
(66 years and 6 months later...)

317
00:24:24.096 --> 00:24:27.366
(unlock the gates of hell
with a sacrificial goat...)

318
00:24:38.110 --> 00:24:39.478
Does he like me?

319
00:24:45.985 --> 00:24:46.985
Don't you think...

320
00:24:47.052 --> 00:24:49.421
Mi-na is the ugliest girl
that Bo-ra brought to us?

321
00:24:49.922 --> 00:24:53.325
She went to a crappy college,
and works to pay for the tuition.

322
00:24:53.392 --> 00:24:56.195
Why is that important?

323
00:24:56.762 --> 00:24:58.397
So long as she's cute and nice.

324
00:24:59.765 --> 00:25:05.604
She's perfect to toy with
before I fly off to the States.

325
00:25:06.438 --> 00:25:08.407
You got a weird taste,

326
00:25:08.474 --> 00:25:10.009
she's too dull for me.

327
00:25:10.976 --> 00:25:13.679
Bo-ra's bringing girls for me,

328
00:25:13.746 --> 00:25:15.681
it's a courtesy to get a taste.

329
00:25:16.582 --> 00:25:18.850
When did you ever
care about courtesy?

330
00:25:18.917 --> 00:25:20.319
Where's Bo-ra?

331
00:25:22.021 --> 00:25:24.156
Where is she?

332
00:25:26.592 --> 00:25:27.659
Bro.

333
00:25:28.494 --> 00:25:32.931
Like you said, we're handsome,
but why can't we get girlfriends?

334
00:25:37.102 --> 00:25:40.572
It's because you didn't
put your heart in it.

335
00:25:40.639 --> 00:25:43.909
Once you do,
you'll get one in no time.

336
00:25:43.976 --> 00:25:45.477
Do we lack anything?

337
00:25:45.544 --> 00:25:49.815
We got a house, a truck,
and very attractive.

338
00:26:02.795 --> 00:26:07.232
Girlfriend is one thing,

339
00:26:07.299 --> 00:26:10.702
let's just make some
female friends quickly.

340
00:26:11.203 --> 00:26:13.105
Party of 3 sounds nice, no?

341
00:26:13.172 --> 00:26:15.340
Good to play card games.

342
00:26:15.407 --> 00:26:18.110
And order take-out food too.

343
00:26:18.177 --> 00:26:19.478
What else, what?

344
00:26:19.878 --> 00:26:20.879
A female person...

345
00:26:26.151 --> 00:26:29.054
(Mi-na)

346
00:26:33.725 --> 00:26:35.527
(You have 9 missed calls)

347
00:26:35.594 --> 00:26:38.063
Your call cannot be connected...

348
00:26:42.868 --> 00:26:45.070
Dammit!

349
00:26:46.872 --> 00:26:48.340
What was that?

350
00:27:23.642 --> 00:27:24.877
You there!

351
00:27:36.321 --> 00:27:37.389
Bro!

352
00:27:43.295 --> 00:27:44.429
Jae-pil!

353
00:27:47.166 --> 00:27:48.300
Bro!

354
00:28:12.324 --> 00:28:14.660
It's that girl
from the market earlier.

355
00:28:15.327 --> 00:28:17.762
Hey there, wake up!

356
00:28:17.829 --> 00:28:20.098
Try to wake up!

357
00:28:20.165 --> 00:28:21.967
- Bro!
- Yeah?

358
00:28:22.935 --> 00:28:24.536
Is she dead?

359
00:28:32.644 --> 00:28:36.081
Don't just sit there,
do a mouth-to-mouth!

360
00:28:36.148 --> 00:28:37.749
Mouth-to-mouth?

361
00:28:37.816 --> 00:28:38.683
With my mouth?

362
00:28:38.750 --> 00:28:40.452
Hurry!

363
00:28:42.721 --> 00:28:44.856
She's dying! Hurry up!

364
00:28:45.791 --> 00:28:46.791
Go on!

365
00:28:58.904 --> 00:29:00.105
You're up!

366
00:29:08.180 --> 00:29:11.316
- She's coming back!
- Where the hell am I?

367
00:29:11.917 --> 00:29:14.519
Move, pricks!

368
00:29:30.202 --> 00:29:31.102
Are they...

369
00:29:31.169 --> 00:29:32.871
Aren't those guys at the mart?

370
00:29:36.174 --> 00:29:37.976
What do we do, baby?

371
00:29:38.043 --> 00:29:39.344
Dammit!

372
00:29:41.046 --> 00:29:42.347
So doomed...

373
00:30:25.991 --> 00:30:27.959
- Kidnapped?
- Yeah!

374
00:30:28.026 --> 00:30:29.961
Those hillbillies from earlier
kidnapped her!

375
00:30:30.028 --> 00:30:32.897
I knew they were up to no good.

376
00:30:32.964 --> 00:30:34.499
Why did she just bolt out of here?

377
00:30:34.566 --> 00:30:36.067
If something happens to her,

378
00:30:36.134 --> 00:30:38.203
we'll get so much crap!

379
00:30:38.270 --> 00:30:39.604
What do we do, Sung-bin?

380
00:30:39.671 --> 00:30:42.040
Let's call the cops first.

381
00:30:44.409 --> 00:30:45.510
My phone...

382
00:30:46.445 --> 00:30:48.213
It was in the jacket
I gave to Mi-na.

383
00:30:49.648 --> 00:30:51.917
- But that...
- What the heck?

384
00:31:00.492 --> 00:31:02.927
Look at this prick.

385
00:31:02.994 --> 00:31:05.497
Getting high too.

386
00:31:06.665 --> 00:31:08.166
He's a piece of crap!

387
00:31:09.000 --> 00:31:11.169
We could make a mint
selling this to the TV station.

388
00:31:12.270 --> 00:31:14.840
(Golfer Lee Sung-bin Golfing
While High on Drugs)

389
00:31:18.410 --> 00:31:19.878
Dammit!

390
00:31:22.647 --> 00:31:24.416
Dude, call my phone!

391
00:31:24.483 --> 00:31:25.483
Okay!

392
00:31:25.784 --> 00:31:27.419
I got no signal!

393
00:31:27.486 --> 00:31:29.054
Mine doesn't work either!

394
00:31:29.121 --> 00:31:30.622
Dammit! Mine too!

395
00:31:30.689 --> 00:31:32.424
We're so dead if it leaks!

396
00:31:32.491 --> 00:31:34.326
You can't play in
the States either!

397
00:31:35.060 --> 00:31:36.194
Dammit!

398
00:31:36.962 --> 00:31:38.663
Don't I know that?

399
00:31:39.631 --> 00:31:42.067
Dude! While we look for Mi-na,

400
00:31:42.134 --> 00:31:43.668
go fetch the police!

401
00:31:43.735 --> 00:31:45.170
- Now!
- Yeah, okay!

402
00:31:48.507 --> 00:31:49.774
Put her in the truck!

403
00:31:49.841 --> 00:31:51.643
What if the hospital's closed?

404
00:31:51.710 --> 00:31:53.111
Let's just go!

405
00:32:04.256 --> 00:32:05.724
Push harder!

406
00:32:17.769 --> 00:32:20.305
You have to do this now?

407
00:32:25.177 --> 00:32:26.344
I hope it gets leaked

408
00:32:26.411 --> 00:32:29.381
and they get totally doomed!

409
00:32:30.382 --> 00:32:31.416
Hooray!

410
00:32:48.900 --> 00:32:51.536
Sung-bin's going to
come at me again...

411
00:33:16.795 --> 00:33:18.463
Stupid goat!

412
00:33:23.134 --> 00:33:24.836
You crazy goat!

413
00:33:24.903 --> 00:33:26.771
Do I look like a loser to you?

414
00:33:26.838 --> 00:33:28.673
Do I look like one?

415
00:33:33.211 --> 00:33:37.516
Loser!

416
00:33:44.189 --> 00:33:46.024
Loser!

417
00:34:14.719 --> 00:34:18.490
Damn, so hot...

418
00:35:59.124 --> 00:36:00.792
You're awake?

419
00:36:08.967 --> 00:36:09.968
Where you going?

420
00:36:12.837 --> 00:36:14.172
Going home, are you?

421
00:36:31.890 --> 00:36:34.259
Are you nuts?

422
00:36:36.961 --> 00:36:38.496
No, no, wait...

423
00:36:40.198 --> 00:36:43.601
Stop it, you pricks!

424
00:36:43.668 --> 00:36:47.238
Stay away from me!

425
00:36:47.305 --> 00:36:48.973
Mommy, help me!

426
00:36:49.040 --> 00:36:50.542
Holy crap!

427
00:36:54.279 --> 00:36:55.447
I'm so scared...

428
00:37:05.390 --> 00:37:06.458
Hungry?

429
00:37:11.029 --> 00:37:12.797
I grilled it with my torch.

430
00:37:12.864 --> 00:37:14.666
I don't know if you'll like it.

431
00:37:15.633 --> 00:37:16.835
Thank you.

432
00:37:17.635 --> 00:37:19.704
Did you really have to
cook her breakfast?

433
00:37:20.405 --> 00:37:24.509
Do you know how much trouble
we got into to rescue you?

434
00:37:24.576 --> 00:37:28.846
Kids nowadays show gratitude
by making a hole on one's head!

435
00:37:28.913 --> 00:37:30.448
She was startled.

436
00:37:32.050 --> 00:37:35.520
I'm sorry, he may seem prickly,

437
00:37:35.587 --> 00:37:37.155
but he's really a warm person,

438
00:37:37.222 --> 00:37:38.232
be a little understanding.

439
00:37:38.256 --> 00:37:42.727
No, I'm the one sorry
for misunderstanding...

440
00:37:43.394 --> 00:37:44.529
I'm really sorry!

441
00:37:44.596 --> 00:37:47.832
Forget it, if you're okay,
get going!

442
00:37:47.899 --> 00:37:49.768
We got a lot of work to do.

443
00:37:50.268 --> 00:37:52.837
But you're my lifesaver,

444
00:37:52.904 --> 00:37:55.006
if you give me your number,
I'll buy you dinner...

445
00:37:55.073 --> 00:37:57.842
010-7105-717...

446
00:37:57.909 --> 00:37:59.510
- Once more...
- Shall I do it for you?

447
00:37:59.577 --> 00:38:00.577
Hey!

448
00:38:01.546 --> 00:38:04.315
You want to let a student
buy you a meal?

449
00:38:06.384 --> 00:38:07.719
You're right.

450
00:38:08.720 --> 00:38:10.688
I'm so rude at times...

451
00:38:12.724 --> 00:38:14.425
But couldn't I get her name?

452
00:38:15.360 --> 00:38:17.428
I'm Kim Mi-na.

453
00:38:17.929 --> 00:38:20.932
I see, you're Kim Mi-na...

454
00:38:23.034 --> 00:38:24.669
I'm Park Sang-go, Mi-na.

455
00:38:26.237 --> 00:38:28.439
My brother is Kang Jae-pil.

456
00:38:28.506 --> 00:38:29.941
We're carpenters.

457
00:38:30.008 --> 00:38:31.743
He's my brother from another mom.

458
00:38:31.810 --> 00:38:33.578
You idiot!

459
00:38:35.480 --> 00:38:37.482
How could you be so crude
in front of a girl?

460
00:38:38.983 --> 00:38:39.983
Apologize.

461
00:38:41.085 --> 00:38:44.222
I'm sorry, Mi-na,
I think I messed up.

462
00:38:44.923 --> 00:38:47.225
If I offended you,
allow me to apologize.

463
00:38:49.460 --> 00:38:51.729
No, it's okay...

464
00:39:00.171 --> 00:39:04.909
Don't worry about treating us,
consider this our dinner.

465
00:39:05.577 --> 00:39:07.512
Bro, come eat with us.

466
00:39:07.579 --> 00:39:11.249
You guys have plenty.

467
00:39:12.483 --> 00:39:13.818
- Dig in.
- Okay.

468
00:39:13.885 --> 00:39:16.855
Thank you for the meal.

469
00:39:21.426 --> 00:39:25.763
Wow, it's goddam...
I mean, it's amazing.

470
00:39:25.830 --> 00:39:27.098
Is that right?

471
00:39:27.765 --> 00:39:29.033
Try this one too.

472
00:39:30.935 --> 00:39:33.838
This house is the only place
left to search.

473
00:39:34.372 --> 00:39:37.709
It's so eerie like
a killers' hideout.

474
00:39:38.543 --> 00:39:41.179
Yong-joon, go check it out.

475
00:39:41.846 --> 00:39:42.846
Me?

476
00:39:43.314 --> 00:39:45.550
Dammit, then should I?

477
00:39:47.986 --> 00:39:49.387
Don't look at me!

478
00:39:50.788 --> 00:39:51.856
Damn you.

479
00:39:54.692 --> 00:39:56.294
- Can I not go?
- You stupid...

480
00:40:16.748 --> 00:40:18.583
What are you doing?!

481
00:40:21.886 --> 00:40:24.822
Stop it! Don't do that!

482
00:40:28.726 --> 00:40:31.495
I'm serious!

483
00:40:31.562 --> 00:40:33.497
I'll do the dishes!

484
00:40:33.564 --> 00:40:34.866
I said I'll do it.

485
00:40:34.933 --> 00:40:37.835
Why are you making me
feel so bad?

486
00:40:41.205 --> 00:40:42.205
All right.

487
00:40:43.174 --> 00:40:44.676
Let's do it together then.

488
00:40:45.677 --> 00:40:47.111
Very well, let's do it together.

489
00:40:48.079 --> 00:40:49.347
One moment.

490
00:40:54.752 --> 00:40:56.654
(Dishwashing Mix Vol. 3)

491
00:41:49.640 --> 00:41:50.640
Bonggu!

492
00:41:59.417 --> 00:42:02.753
So, this is "Stockholm Syndrome".

493
00:42:02.820 --> 00:42:03.964
(Stockholm Syndrome:
An experience of a victim)

494
00:42:03.988 --> 00:42:05.708
(feeling positive
towards their perpetrator)

495
00:42:16.834 --> 00:42:18.903
Aren't you just over the moon?

496
00:42:42.860 --> 00:42:44.529
Run away!

497
00:43:00.078 --> 00:43:03.881
Wathps! Geh away!

498
00:43:07.251 --> 00:43:10.388
Take yur fren! Hurryy!

499
00:43:11.556 --> 00:43:14.826
Can'th you undtherstand me?

500
00:43:19.063 --> 00:43:22.233
Take yur fren with you!

501
00:43:25.269 --> 00:43:26.537
That hurts...

502
00:43:31.576 --> 00:43:35.446
Jason! Where are you?

503
00:43:39.083 --> 00:43:40.785
You jerk!

504
00:44:00.571 --> 00:44:02.140
- Officer Nam.
- Yes, sir?

505
00:44:02.707 --> 00:44:04.508
Any new cases overnight?

506
00:44:04.575 --> 00:44:08.879
One drunken tractor accident,
and nothing else, why?

507
00:44:08.946 --> 00:44:10.948
Those jerks from yesterday,

508
00:44:11.983 --> 00:44:14.251
don't they rub you the wrong way?

509
00:44:14.318 --> 00:44:16.587
How could they look so shady
but not have any priors?

510
00:44:16.654 --> 00:44:18.756
They seemed like good people.

511
00:44:18.823 --> 00:44:21.792
They even removed roadkill, why?

512
00:44:22.293 --> 00:44:25.296
That's why you'll never make it.

513
00:44:25.363 --> 00:44:27.331
Do you know what I was
called in Major Crimes?

514
00:44:27.398 --> 00:44:28.533
No clue.

515
00:44:29.000 --> 00:44:31.869
"Ghost Eyes", man,
that's who I was.

516
00:44:31.936 --> 00:44:34.772
Even ghosts didn't mess with me.

517
00:44:34.839 --> 00:44:36.007
Do you know why?

518
00:44:37.141 --> 00:44:38.742
When I look at them like this,

519
00:44:38.809 --> 00:44:41.679
I can tell who's a ghost
and who's not.

520
00:44:41.746 --> 00:44:44.148
Holy crap, ghost!

521
00:44:45.917 --> 00:44:46.917
What the heck?

522
00:44:50.021 --> 00:44:52.156
- Tell him to stay back!
- What are you doing?

523
00:44:53.090 --> 00:44:56.427
Who are you?
Stay away from us!

524
00:44:57.195 --> 00:44:58.496
Stay back!

525
00:44:59.297 --> 00:45:00.297
What?

526
00:45:00.331 --> 00:45:01.699
What the heck is this jerk?

527
00:45:01.766 --> 00:45:03.601
- Stay back!
- What?!

528
00:45:04.402 --> 00:45:05.670
Why? Why?

529
00:45:06.437 --> 00:45:09.807
- The goat went maa...
- What?

530
00:45:09.874 --> 00:45:12.710
It screamed 'Loser'!

531
00:45:12.777 --> 00:45:17.114
Holy crap! Just go!

532
00:45:17.181 --> 00:45:17.948
- Hold on!
- Help me!

533
00:45:18.015 --> 00:45:21.619
(Bo-ra, I'm going back to Seoul)

534
00:45:28.059 --> 00:45:29.760
Where did he go?

535
00:45:30.528 --> 00:45:31.862
You have to go, right?

536
00:45:32.363 --> 00:45:33.707
When he comes back,
he'll drive you.

537
00:45:33.731 --> 00:45:35.533
I actually can't drive.

538
00:45:36.234 --> 00:45:39.470
It's okay, I can wait.

539
00:45:43.040 --> 00:45:44.875
(Paint thinner (do not drink))

540
00:45:52.550 --> 00:45:55.086
I wish people were...

541
00:45:55.820 --> 00:45:58.389
good to each other
like paint and thinner.

542
00:45:59.056 --> 00:46:00.091
Pardon?

543
00:46:01.592 --> 00:46:06.097
It looked like you had a fight
with your friends last night.

544
00:46:08.165 --> 00:46:09.165
Yes...

545
00:46:10.601 --> 00:46:12.336
Don't be too sad.

546
00:46:13.237 --> 00:46:16.774
I only have Jae-pil to fight with.

547
00:46:27.084 --> 00:46:28.953
What's wrong with me?

548
00:46:44.101 --> 00:46:47.171
Bro, what took you so long?

549
00:46:49.874 --> 00:46:51.709
What's with your face?

550
00:46:51.776 --> 00:46:54.145
I... I...

551
00:47:11.762 --> 00:47:15.166
I told you to get rid of
the wasp nest, didn't I?

552
00:47:22.606 --> 00:47:28.012
This is how serial killers
show off their kills.

553
00:47:29.080 --> 00:47:30.548
We can't handle these guys.

554
00:47:31.248 --> 00:47:32.583
Let's head back.

555
00:47:32.650 --> 00:47:36.287
Head back where?
We have to get our revenge!

556
00:47:36.354 --> 00:47:37.621
Do you not see this?

557
00:47:38.255 --> 00:47:40.524
They're absolute psychos!

558
00:47:41.492 --> 00:47:44.295
Let's go get those guys.

559
00:47:44.362 --> 00:47:45.362
Sung-bin...

560
00:47:46.664 --> 00:47:48.799
It doesn't matter
if they're killers or devils,

561
00:47:48.866 --> 00:47:51.402
I have to find my phone!

562
00:47:51.469 --> 00:47:52.870
Yes! Let's go!

563
00:47:52.937 --> 00:47:55.506
Let's get those psychos.

564
00:47:56.173 --> 00:47:57.675
You've never seen horror movies?

565
00:47:58.509 --> 00:48:01.178
This is how we all get killed!

566
00:48:04.014 --> 00:48:05.683
Easy, go easy!

567
00:48:05.750 --> 00:48:06.750
All right.

568
00:48:07.151 --> 00:48:08.352
That hurts!

569
00:48:09.487 --> 00:48:10.821
Put this on your face.

570
00:48:12.056 --> 00:48:14.391
The site must be really bad.

571
00:48:14.458 --> 00:48:15.702
Shouldn't we really
do some prayers?

572
00:48:15.726 --> 00:48:17.128
Forget it!

573
00:48:18.329 --> 00:48:19.697
The site was bad to begin with.

574
00:48:21.132 --> 00:48:24.468
By the way, I met your friends
in front of the house.

575
00:48:25.169 --> 00:48:26.970
- My friends?
- Yeah.

576
00:48:27.037 --> 00:48:28.939
It looked like they came for you,

577
00:48:29.006 --> 00:48:32.076
but they ran away
when they saw the wasps.

578
00:48:32.143 --> 00:48:34.178
Is that right?
That's great then.

579
00:48:34.245 --> 00:48:36.280
You could just wait for them here!

580
00:48:36.347 --> 00:48:38.249
Why the hell for?

581
00:48:39.049 --> 00:48:40.584
We'll tell your friends you left.

582
00:48:43.087 --> 00:48:44.088
All right.

583
00:48:44.922 --> 00:48:45.922
No need to get angry.

584
00:48:49.827 --> 00:48:51.962
I wasn't angry.

585
00:48:52.029 --> 00:48:53.029
You were.

586
00:48:53.697 --> 00:48:55.533
It's because I got stung.

587
00:48:58.169 --> 00:48:59.437
Fine, fine, fine.

588
00:49:01.372 --> 00:49:03.073
Whether you wait or not,

589
00:49:03.841 --> 00:49:05.709
do whatever you want, ma'am.

590
00:49:08.279 --> 00:49:09.647
What do you want to do, Mi-na?

591
00:49:11.749 --> 00:49:14.518
I'll wait here until they come.

592
00:49:14.585 --> 00:49:16.320
And I can help you
with your work too.

593
00:49:16.921 --> 00:49:18.756
You don't need to help.

594
00:49:22.426 --> 00:49:24.261
(Housecleaning Mix Vol. 5)

595
00:49:36.774 --> 00:49:40.744
You're so good at everything!

596
00:49:40.811 --> 00:49:43.948
I always wanted to take up art.

597
00:49:45.616 --> 00:49:47.785
Very nice!

598
00:49:48.452 --> 00:49:50.220
Let's take a photo.

599
00:49:50.287 --> 00:49:51.021
Photo?

600
00:49:51.088 --> 00:49:52.088
Yeah, selfie.

601
00:49:52.122 --> 00:49:53.642
(Jae-pil & Sang-gu's Home
(and Bonggu))

602
00:49:54.291 --> 00:49:56.060
One, two, three!

603
00:50:05.002 --> 00:50:06.503
What are you making?

604
00:50:06.570 --> 00:50:11.308
It's a planter to grow
lettuce and artichoke.

605
00:50:13.277 --> 00:50:14.478
Can I try?

606
00:50:15.479 --> 00:50:18.015
- But it's dangerous.
- I want to try.

607
00:50:19.049 --> 00:50:22.653
Hold tight, and aim it here,
pull the trigger.

608
00:50:23.621 --> 00:50:26.123
Eh? It's not working.

609
00:50:26.524 --> 00:50:30.828
It's an old compressor,
it unplugs often.

610
00:50:31.996 --> 00:50:33.230
It'll work now.

611
00:50:34.832 --> 00:50:36.000
It works!

612
00:50:45.709 --> 00:50:46.709
Aren't I good?

613
00:50:49.747 --> 00:50:51.748
Help with what?!

614
00:50:51.815 --> 00:50:53.551
They're just fooling around!

615
00:50:54.919 --> 00:50:59.390
Yo, Park Sang-go,
how could you do this to me?

616
00:50:59.990 --> 00:51:01.358
You like her that much?

617
00:51:02.626 --> 00:51:05.496
You love her enough
to kick me to the curb?

618
00:51:07.965 --> 00:51:09.466
Answer me!

619
00:51:15.873 --> 00:51:18.309
Fotget you all!

620
00:51:39.663 --> 00:51:41.532
How is it in the back?

621
00:51:42.366 --> 00:51:45.202
The chainsaw killer is
very hyped up.

622
00:51:45.269 --> 00:51:47.404
The post-murder adrenaline
must be in overdrive.

623
00:51:49.540 --> 00:51:51.141
This guy's worst.

624
00:51:51.208 --> 00:51:53.611
He's forcing Mi-na to
make her own coffin.

625
00:51:55.913 --> 00:51:59.650
She's crying while
making her own coffin?

626
00:52:00.184 --> 00:52:00.884
What's wrong?

627
00:52:00.951 --> 00:52:03.520
I think something went in my eye.

628
00:52:04.088 --> 00:52:05.089
Let me see.

629
00:52:10.527 --> 00:52:11.695
Is that good?

630
00:52:11.762 --> 00:52:13.497
Uh, yeah, that did it.

631
00:52:14.932 --> 00:52:16.800
No more nailing,
you did plenty already.

632
00:52:24.274 --> 00:52:26.977
What is he doing?

633
00:52:29.279 --> 00:52:31.381
One, two, three!

634
00:52:31.448 --> 00:52:32.983
One, two, three!

635
00:52:33.751 --> 00:52:37.621
He's photographing
the entire murder process!

636
00:52:39.123 --> 00:52:40.858
This planter looks like a coffin!

637
00:52:43.794 --> 00:52:47.665
They must've escaped
from an insane asylum!

638
00:52:51.902 --> 00:52:54.104
Yong-joon and I'll take him,

639
00:52:54.171 --> 00:52:57.874
Jason, you avenge
your girl's killer.

640
00:52:57.941 --> 00:53:00.911
Then we get my phone back,
can you do that?

641
00:53:04.948 --> 00:53:06.150
Don't worry.

642
00:53:08.519 --> 00:53:11.355
One shot, one kill.

643
00:53:50.527 --> 00:53:51.528
Sung-bin.

644
00:53:58.569 --> 00:54:00.637
Mi-na's friends are here.

645
00:54:06.543 --> 00:54:07.878
Attack!

646
00:54:24.661 --> 00:54:25.661
Sung-bin...

647
00:54:56.560 --> 00:54:57.561
Are you...

648
00:54:58.595 --> 00:54:59.596
Blood!

649
00:55:13.443 --> 00:55:14.945
Die!

650
00:55:19.283 --> 00:55:21.285
Who are you?
What happened?!

651
00:55:22.619 --> 00:55:25.122
Get out of there!

652
00:55:25.989 --> 00:55:28.358
Oh my god!

653
00:55:29.893 --> 00:55:31.328
I'll cover him for now...

654
00:55:33.330 --> 00:55:34.731
What are we supposed to do?

655
00:55:35.432 --> 00:55:36.509
What in the world is going on?

656
00:55:36.533 --> 00:55:39.903
Sang-go! Sang-go!

657
00:55:39.970 --> 00:55:40.904
What is it?

658
00:55:40.971 --> 00:55:42.405
- Sang-go!
- Bro, what is it?

659
00:55:42.472 --> 00:55:44.040
We got a big problem!

660
00:55:44.107 --> 00:55:47.778
While I was looking away,

661
00:55:47.845 --> 00:55:50.313
some guy jumped

662
00:55:50.380 --> 00:55:54.184
into
the wood chipper by himself!

663
00:55:54.251 --> 00:55:56.419
Why'd someone jump
into the wood chipper?

664
00:55:56.486 --> 00:55:57.921
How should I know?

665
00:55:57.988 --> 00:55:59.388
It's not like
he gave me a heads-up!

666
00:56:02.426 --> 00:56:06.230
So, is he dead or alive?

667
00:56:06.997 --> 00:56:09.199
- Tomato paste...
- Tomato paste?

668
00:56:09.666 --> 00:56:12.269
He's shredded like tomato paste!

669
00:56:19.676 --> 00:56:21.111
What is that?

670
00:56:21.845 --> 00:56:23.285
Look over there,
there's another one.

671
00:56:27.851 --> 00:56:30.554
Mi-na! Mi-na!

672
00:56:42.566 --> 00:56:44.001
A bite mark...

673
00:56:56.680 --> 00:56:59.316
So, everyone left to look

674
00:56:59.383 --> 00:57:01.318
for your kidnapped friend
at night?

675
00:57:02.519 --> 00:57:04.087
They didn't leave to rescue her...

676
00:57:04.154 --> 00:57:06.490
- Yes?
- But they still left.

677
00:57:07.724 --> 00:57:10.127
You guys got balls...

678
00:57:13.497 --> 00:57:14.531
Wait a minute!

679
00:57:17.334 --> 00:57:19.603
You said there were
2 kidnappers?

680
00:57:22.572 --> 00:57:26.042
Did they have a weird looking dog?

681
00:57:26.109 --> 00:57:27.311
Yes, that jerk!

682
00:57:27.844 --> 00:57:30.414
Those jerks, I knew it.

683
00:57:31.148 --> 00:57:33.283
- Officer Nam!
- Yes?

684
00:57:33.350 --> 00:57:35.419
We're moving out! Let's go!

685
00:57:36.620 --> 00:57:37.788
Get over here.

686
00:57:56.740 --> 00:57:57.740
How is she?

687
00:57:58.308 --> 00:57:59.776
She must've gotten a lot of shock.

688
00:58:03.146 --> 00:58:04.381
Rightly so.

689
00:58:05.115 --> 00:58:07.884
We should report
this first, right?

690
00:58:10.053 --> 00:58:12.055
If we do,

691
00:58:13.623 --> 00:58:15.592
one bad move
could get us locked up.

692
00:58:15.659 --> 00:58:18.428
Why do we go to jail?

693
00:58:18.495 --> 00:58:19.796
That's what this looks like.

694
00:58:19.863 --> 00:58:21.898
If we tell cops

695
00:58:21.965 --> 00:58:23.376
that these kids
just killed themselves,

696
00:58:23.400 --> 00:58:25.669
do you think they'll believe us?

697
00:58:26.303 --> 00:58:28.448
They could have come here
to really just commit suicide.

698
00:58:28.472 --> 00:58:30.207
Mi-na jumped into the lake
last night too.

699
00:58:30.941 --> 00:58:33.376
Does she look like
someone who'd kill herself?

700
00:58:33.443 --> 00:58:35.779
She devoured her meal

701
00:58:35.846 --> 00:58:37.447
and played so well with you.

702
00:58:37.514 --> 00:58:38.715
Right...

703
00:58:38.782 --> 00:58:41.852
And why'd suicidal kids
try to attack you?

704
00:58:42.486 --> 00:58:44.421
Yeah, they jumped at me.

705
00:58:44.488 --> 00:58:45.655
It looks to me,

706
00:58:47.824 --> 00:58:50.493
Mi-na and her friends,

707
00:58:50.560 --> 00:58:54.097
they might all be part of a cult.

708
00:58:54.698 --> 00:58:56.166
You know that thing,

709
00:58:56.233 --> 00:59:00.470
giving themselves up
to be a sacrifice.

710
00:59:00.537 --> 00:59:01.604
Mi-na was the sacrifice.

711
00:59:01.671 --> 00:59:02.772
And she fled.

712
00:59:02.839 --> 00:59:04.374
Yes, she betrayed them.

713
00:59:06.676 --> 00:59:07.811
Maybe not?

714
00:59:09.112 --> 00:59:14.384
What if it was a bucket list
or something.

715
00:59:16.286 --> 00:59:18.255
Like "kill someone before dying".

716
00:59:20.457 --> 00:59:24.161
That's possible,
kids are crazy these days.

717
00:59:28.899 --> 00:59:30.200
Maybe a YouTuber?

718
00:59:30.967 --> 00:59:32.302
Creator...

719
00:59:41.011 --> 00:59:42.079
Dammit...

720
00:59:54.991 --> 00:59:56.326
- What the...
- Sorry about that.

721
01:00:11.842 --> 01:00:13.510
Yong-joon...

722
01:00:13.577 --> 01:00:17.581
Pricks, what the hell
went on here?

723
01:00:20.050 --> 01:00:22.586
Captain, there's something
you need to see in the back!

724
01:00:24.721 --> 01:00:28.391
Looks like someone dug this
to bury a body secretly.

725
01:00:29.793 --> 01:00:32.896
All the pieces are
falling into place,

726
01:00:32.963 --> 01:00:35.232
don't you think?

727
01:00:38.969 --> 01:00:41.304
Crazy psycho...

728
01:00:43.140 --> 01:00:45.809
They were totally having
a slaughter party!

729
01:00:49.079 --> 01:00:50.147
Take it!

730
01:00:54.284 --> 01:00:55.151
Those pricks...

731
01:00:55.218 --> 01:00:56.620
Holy crap!

732
01:00:57.387 --> 01:00:59.422
They're very intelligent psychos.

733
01:00:59.789 --> 01:01:01.558
Do not underestimate them.

734
01:01:01.625 --> 01:01:02.625
Sung-bin...

735
01:01:05.395 --> 01:01:06.973
Hey, hey, what was that for?
Please calm down!

736
01:01:06.997 --> 01:01:09.199
What took you so long?

737
01:01:09.266 --> 01:01:11.401
The goat went crazy!

738
01:01:11.468 --> 01:01:12.936
Don't give me that nonsense!

739
01:01:13.003 --> 01:01:14.070
Stop it!

740
01:01:14.137 --> 01:01:16.806
Getting worked up
won't solve this case!

741
01:01:17.974 --> 01:01:19.142
I'm the one solving it.

742
01:01:19.643 --> 01:01:21.211
Christ...

743
01:01:21.811 --> 01:01:23.380
Do you know where
those pricks are?

744
01:01:24.147 --> 01:01:25.949
I don't know, I passed out.

745
01:01:27.817 --> 01:01:31.154
But I'm certain
they've laid traps

746
01:01:31.221 --> 01:01:32.922
for us to walk in.

747
01:01:32.989 --> 01:01:33.990
Trap?

748
01:01:34.591 --> 01:01:36.393
- Officer Nam.
- Yes?

749
01:01:37.127 --> 01:01:38.828
I'll take a look inside,

750
01:01:39.729 --> 01:01:41.097
go back to the car with them.

751
01:01:44.134 --> 01:01:45.134
Let's go.

752
01:01:46.269 --> 01:01:48.305
Goddamn jerks...

753
01:02:20.370 --> 01:02:22.071
When we go to jail,

754
01:02:22.138 --> 01:02:24.174
who's going to feed Bonggu?

755
01:02:24.241 --> 01:02:25.275
Let's turn ourselves in,

756
01:02:25.342 --> 01:02:26.242
and ask them to cut us some slack.

757
01:02:26.309 --> 01:02:29.112
Turn ourselves in for Bonggu?

758
01:02:29.679 --> 01:02:32.916
Then while you talk to the cops,

759
01:02:32.983 --> 01:02:34.918
I'll pull out the guy
in the wood chipper.

760
01:02:34.985 --> 01:02:35.752
It'll look disgusting.

761
01:02:35.819 --> 01:02:37.620
Just let it be!

762
01:02:37.687 --> 01:02:38.864
You'll only add more fingerprints

763
01:02:38.888 --> 01:02:41.157
and give them extra evidence!

764
01:02:41.224 --> 01:02:45.028
Covering their tracks...

765
01:02:45.095 --> 01:02:47.364
I'll talk to them.

766
01:02:48.064 --> 01:02:49.566
You just stay
quietly beside me, okay?

767
01:02:50.100 --> 01:02:51.101
Okay.

768
01:02:51.835 --> 01:02:53.103
Booyah!

769
01:02:59.042 --> 01:03:00.910
Don't move, jerks!

770
01:03:01.411 --> 01:03:03.113
You psychotic pricks!

771
01:03:03.980 --> 01:03:05.282
What's that?

772
01:03:06.616 --> 01:03:09.185
You goddamn perverts!

773
01:03:09.252 --> 01:03:11.955
I told you not to cause
any trouble!

774
01:03:12.789 --> 01:03:13.789
Hands up and come out!

775
01:03:16.593 --> 01:03:17.593
Out!

776
01:03:19.362 --> 01:03:22.098
Get out, go on!

777
01:03:26.036 --> 01:03:27.503
Don't move.

778
01:03:27.570 --> 01:03:29.906
Mr. Police, look at
the crime scene calmly...

779
01:03:29.973 --> 01:03:32.409
Shut the hell up!

780
01:03:32.776 --> 01:03:33.776
Get down on the floor!

781
01:03:36.546 --> 01:03:37.781
Hands up!

782
01:03:38.315 --> 01:03:40.617
Hands on your hips!

783
01:03:41.051 --> 01:03:43.119
Hands behind your hips!

784
01:03:45.889 --> 01:03:48.825
You thought you could
fool Ghost Eyes?

785
01:03:49.959 --> 01:03:52.495
I knew you two were
up to no good.

786
01:03:54.364 --> 01:03:55.965
Be careful there!

787
01:03:56.032 --> 01:03:57.334
Shut your mo...

788
01:04:03.406 --> 01:04:05.141
You didn't fix the column yet?

789
01:04:15.785 --> 01:04:17.120
You jerks...

790
01:04:17.187 --> 01:04:20.256
You laid... a trap...

791
01:04:21.725 --> 01:04:24.361
Trap... Taid a lrap...

792
01:04:26.029 --> 01:04:27.597
- Stay back!
- Are you okay?

793
01:04:29.065 --> 01:04:31.000
Stop! Stay back!

794
01:04:48.184 --> 01:04:49.352
Captain!

795
01:04:53.189 --> 01:04:55.692
It's a trap, get backup...

796
01:04:58.428 --> 01:04:59.729
Fire! Fire!

797
01:05:01.531 --> 01:05:03.867
This is bad! I'm on fire!

798
01:05:04.667 --> 01:05:07.370
Water! Over here! Help!

799
01:05:12.041 --> 01:05:13.476
Thank you, sir!

800
01:05:14.544 --> 01:05:16.379
Bro, out of the way!

801
01:05:16.446 --> 01:05:18.147
Water, water!

802
01:05:18.214 --> 01:05:19.382
It's almost extinguished!

803
01:05:23.219 --> 01:05:24.821
Stay away!

804
01:05:37.934 --> 01:05:38.934
Bro...

805
01:05:39.502 --> 01:05:40.703
What happened...

806
01:05:41.571 --> 01:05:42.572
Sang-go,

807
01:05:43.440 --> 01:05:47.677
didn't I tell you not to put
the thinner in plastic bottles?

808
01:05:48.611 --> 01:05:50.113
(Paint thinner (do not drink))

809
01:05:53.516 --> 01:05:57.320
You there! You're not dead yet!

810
01:05:58.254 --> 01:05:59.923
You crazy devils!

811
01:06:00.623 --> 01:06:02.926
No, I'm not dead yet!

812
01:06:06.095 --> 01:06:07.697
Sang-go! Run!

813
01:06:07.764 --> 01:06:08.965
Die!

814
01:06:13.636 --> 01:06:15.838
Don't get worked up,

815
01:06:15.905 --> 01:06:18.074
let's talk about this!

816
01:06:18.141 --> 01:06:20.076
Shut up, you killers!

817
01:06:25.448 --> 01:06:28.351
Our home's getting destroyed!

818
01:06:28.418 --> 01:06:30.820
So much trouble after saving
a drowning girl!

819
01:06:35.592 --> 01:06:38.594
But we're glad at least
he's not dead, right?

820
01:06:38.661 --> 01:06:41.464
Who the hell cares!
He's about to kill us!

821
01:06:43.299 --> 01:06:46.069
That's Bonggu, right?

822
01:06:49.739 --> 01:06:51.241
Is this your dog?

823
01:06:53.343 --> 01:06:55.044
Give up and come out!

824
01:06:55.578 --> 01:06:58.348
Or this dog gets it!

825
01:07:00.316 --> 01:07:01.316
- Bro!
- What?

826
01:07:01.351 --> 01:07:03.586
Those guys kidnapped Bonggu!

827
01:07:05.855 --> 01:07:08.758
Bonggu is innocent!

828
01:07:08.825 --> 01:07:10.927
He's threatening to kill him!

829
01:07:20.770 --> 01:07:22.639
Come on out...

830
01:07:30.013 --> 01:07:31.347
What was that?

831
01:07:35.285 --> 01:07:36.553
Holy crap!

832
01:07:45.395 --> 01:07:46.396
I killed him.

833
01:07:47.997 --> 01:07:49.198
Bonggu!

834
01:07:53.870 --> 01:07:55.204
Bro, now!

835
01:08:13.056 --> 01:08:14.156
- Sang-go!
- What?

836
01:08:14.223 --> 01:08:15.258
- There!
- You jerk!

837
01:08:18.928 --> 01:08:20.163
How dare you!

838
01:08:21.564 --> 01:08:23.066
Get that prick!

839
01:08:28.071 --> 01:08:30.273
Bro, did you rescue Bonggu?

840
01:08:30.840 --> 01:08:32.041
Sang-go...

841
01:08:32.942 --> 01:08:34.010
Sang...

842
01:08:35.378 --> 01:08:36.579
Sang-go!

843
01:08:39.248 --> 01:08:40.283
Mi-na!

844
01:08:41.684 --> 01:08:43.853
What's happening here?

845
01:08:44.420 --> 01:08:45.421
The thing is...

846
01:08:46.255 --> 01:08:49.759
that guy who was electrocuted,
he's alive!

847
01:08:53.029 --> 01:08:54.597
Jae-pil, where did you go?

848
01:08:55.298 --> 01:08:58.401
Bro! Bonggu!

849
01:08:58.835 --> 01:09:04.707
(Gonjiam)

850
01:09:04.774 --> 01:09:06.876
Oh Lord...

851
01:09:13.916 --> 01:09:15.084
Father!

852
01:09:15.551 --> 01:09:17.253
Child-Murdering Yankee,
Go Back Home!

853
01:09:17.320 --> 01:09:20.222
Father Baker, please don't leave!

854
01:09:20.289 --> 01:09:22.291
I'm the one
who ruined the exorcism...

855
01:09:22.959 --> 01:09:25.494
When the demon returns,

856
01:09:25.561 --> 01:09:28.865
you will be the only one
capable of stopping him.

857
01:09:29.565 --> 01:09:31.100
God will help you.

858
01:09:31.167 --> 01:09:33.302
Father...

859
01:09:36.305 --> 01:09:38.241
What are you saying?

860
01:09:39.575 --> 01:09:41.978
I don't know English.

861
01:09:49.819 --> 01:09:50.819
Father!

862
01:09:51.154 --> 01:09:54.023
Excuse me? Mr. Baker!

863
01:09:54.090 --> 01:09:55.925
Please don't leave!

864
01:09:55.992 --> 01:09:57.593
Excuse me?

865
01:09:57.660 --> 01:10:00.596
Hello! Mr. Baker!

866
01:10:01.164 --> 01:10:03.733
Hey!

867
01:10:13.976 --> 01:10:16.679
Book, Father Baker's book!

868
01:10:17.346 --> 01:10:18.915
Over there...

869
01:10:28.024 --> 01:10:30.860
Doctor! Father is awake!

870
01:10:31.861 --> 01:10:35.598
66 years and 6 months later,

871
01:10:35.665 --> 01:10:39.469
5 malignant spirits
will sacrifice a goat,

872
01:10:40.203 --> 01:10:42.638
and open the gates of hell,

873
01:10:42.705 --> 01:10:46.275
and they too will be sacrificed,

874
01:10:46.342 --> 01:10:48.844
and with the help of a fool

875
01:10:48.911 --> 01:10:51.447
who can't distinguish
good from evil,

876
01:10:51.514 --> 01:10:56.486
Baphomet will rise
and light the world on fire.

877
01:11:04.360 --> 01:11:06.295
This is for Bo-ra!

878
01:11:06.362 --> 01:11:08.364
This is for Yong-joon!

879
01:11:08.431 --> 01:11:10.733
This is for Jason!

880
01:11:11.234 --> 01:11:12.869
Boys...

881
01:11:13.770 --> 01:11:16.072
We really didn't kill them.

882
01:11:17.707 --> 01:11:19.208
Please stop hitting me...

883
01:11:19.275 --> 01:11:23.446
I'm going to make you
spit blood and die.

884
01:11:25.715 --> 01:11:26.849
Bro!

885
01:11:27.917 --> 01:11:29.252
Bonggu!

886
01:11:31.888 --> 01:11:33.022
Jae-pil!

887
01:11:39.395 --> 01:11:40.529
Sang-go!

888
01:11:40.596 --> 01:11:42.031
Sir!

889
01:11:42.098 --> 01:11:44.333
You thought
you could mess with me?

890
01:11:44.400 --> 01:11:45.935
Sang-go...

891
01:11:46.302 --> 01:11:47.803
Sung-bin!

892
01:11:47.870 --> 01:11:50.973
These men aren't what you think.

893
01:11:51.674 --> 01:11:53.309
We misunderstood them.

894
01:11:53.376 --> 01:11:55.678
They're just ordinary people!

895
01:11:55.745 --> 01:11:57.379
You didn't see our dead friends?

896
01:11:57.446 --> 01:12:00.983
But... they didn't kill them,

897
01:12:01.050 --> 01:12:04.554
they were all accidents!

898
01:12:05.087 --> 01:12:08.391
It tears me apart
that they were killed...

899
01:12:10.393 --> 01:12:12.461
They all died
while looking for me.

900
01:12:13.095 --> 01:12:14.230
Moron...

901
01:12:18.701 --> 01:12:20.536
We didn't come looking for you,

902
01:12:22.271 --> 01:12:24.440
we came back for this.

903
01:12:24.507 --> 01:12:27.977
This is far more important
than a loser like you.

904
01:12:28.911 --> 01:12:30.012
Buddy.

905
01:12:30.613 --> 01:12:32.915
Aren't you being too rude
to your friend?

906
01:12:33.516 --> 01:12:34.617
Friend?

907
01:12:35.351 --> 01:12:36.619
Who's friend?

908
01:12:39.856 --> 01:12:43.058
Losers are always so delusional.

909
01:12:43.125 --> 01:12:46.962
That's why you get back stabbed
by your so-called friends.

910
01:12:47.029 --> 01:12:48.965
Stupid idiots!

911
01:12:56.038 --> 01:12:59.308
Idiot? You think you're different?

912
01:12:59.375 --> 01:13:02.711
If I leak this,
you're the one doomed.

913
01:13:02.778 --> 01:13:06.682
Damn you, rising star!

914
01:13:10.019 --> 01:13:12.321
Lee Sung-bin, hope you fail!

915
01:13:14.457 --> 01:13:17.727
Did you just get back stabbed?

916
01:13:22.231 --> 01:13:24.133
Goddammit...

917
01:13:29.872 --> 01:13:31.974
Ghost, ghost!

918
01:13:32.041 --> 01:13:35.077
Ghost! Sung-bin, ghost!

919
01:13:35.144 --> 01:13:36.445
Are you kidding me?

920
01:13:36.512 --> 01:13:39.682
Where's my phone?

921
01:13:39.749 --> 01:13:42.084
It's the Demonic Goat!

922
01:14:00.870 --> 01:14:01.904
Bo-ra?

923
01:14:02.505 --> 01:14:03.505
What? Bo-ra?

924
01:14:03.572 --> 01:14:05.942
That's not Bo-ra,
it's a ghost...

925
01:14:06.609 --> 01:14:07.610
Mi-na,

926
01:14:09.445 --> 01:14:10.813
is your friend sick?

927
01:14:30.466 --> 01:14:32.468
What's with her?

928
01:14:34.904 --> 01:14:36.605
What's the matter with you?

929
01:14:37.606 --> 01:14:39.375
Miss, what's wrong?

930
01:14:51.320 --> 01:14:52.488
Bo-ra...

931
01:14:58.828 --> 01:15:01.530
Loser!

932
01:15:01.597 --> 01:15:04.099
Are they out of their minds?

933
01:15:04.166 --> 01:15:06.836
Ghost... Demonic Goat!

934
01:15:07.770 --> 01:15:11.106
Bo-ra is haunted
by Demonic Goat...

935
01:15:11.173 --> 01:15:14.610
I thought the old fart
was pulling my leg...

936
01:15:15.778 --> 01:15:18.147
I have to get out of here!
I need to go!

937
01:15:24.186 --> 01:15:26.088
Did he just say "ghost"?

938
01:15:27.757 --> 01:15:29.091
I'm not sure...

939
01:15:29.825 --> 01:15:31.327
Forget ghosts!

940
01:15:32.161 --> 01:15:35.197
They got high together,
that's what happened.

941
01:15:35.998 --> 01:15:37.700
Come on, untie me!

942
01:15:37.767 --> 01:15:39.301
Oh yeah! Bro!

943
01:15:50.946 --> 01:15:53.015
Where's the truck key...

944
01:16:01.123 --> 01:16:03.025
They claim innocence,

945
01:16:03.626 --> 01:16:05.127
and yet they have a gun?

946
01:16:05.194 --> 01:16:06.529
Bonggu!

947
01:16:08.964 --> 01:16:10.399
Bro, where's Bonggu?

948
01:16:11.000 --> 01:16:12.801
Consider it lucky.

949
01:16:12.868 --> 01:16:14.770
If we were both taken,

950
01:16:14.837 --> 01:16:17.606
he'd have spit blood too.

951
01:16:17.673 --> 01:16:19.174
Don't worry too much.

952
01:16:19.241 --> 01:16:21.710
He's smart enough
to find his way home.

953
01:16:23.913 --> 01:16:24.680
What is it?

954
01:16:24.747 --> 01:16:28.884
Key! Give me the truck key,
your murderers!

955
01:16:28.951 --> 01:16:31.920
What's with you?
It's all a big misunderstanding!

956
01:16:31.987 --> 01:16:33.355
Shut up!

957
01:16:33.422 --> 01:16:35.858
Just give me the damn key!

958
01:16:35.925 --> 01:16:36.926
Hey.

959
01:16:38.227 --> 01:16:42.064
Get your head together,

960
01:16:43.165 --> 01:16:44.767
you pathetic loser.

961
01:16:44.834 --> 01:16:47.269
Are you so desperate to die?

962
01:16:49.105 --> 01:16:50.406
Key!

963
01:16:50.840 --> 01:16:53.943
Mi-na, give this key to him.

964
01:16:54.577 --> 01:16:55.978
Tell him to get out of our home.

965
01:17:00.049 --> 01:17:01.217
Gents,

966
01:17:03.185 --> 01:17:04.353
I'm really sorry.

967
01:17:08.424 --> 01:17:09.859
Get lost, jerk!

968
01:17:10.326 --> 01:17:13.696
They say idiots stick together.

969
01:17:20.102 --> 01:17:21.170
Byung-jo?

970
01:17:22.204 --> 01:17:23.205
Sung-bin?

971
01:17:29.979 --> 01:17:30.979
Outside.

972
01:17:34.750 --> 01:17:35.750
It's here.

973
01:17:36.485 --> 01:17:37.620
What is it now?

974
01:17:38.287 --> 01:17:41.056
What's he yapping about now?

975
01:17:42.158 --> 01:17:44.527
Demonic Goat is here!

976
01:18:12.821 --> 01:18:15.157
You goddamn loser!

977
01:18:22.431 --> 01:18:23.532
Byung-jo...

978
01:18:24.033 --> 01:18:25.367
What's wrong?

979
01:18:29.238 --> 01:18:31.707
He must be haunted
by a ghost too...

980
01:18:31.774 --> 01:18:35.211
I don't see any ghosts.

981
01:18:37.680 --> 01:18:38.881
Sung-bin.

982
01:18:41.183 --> 01:18:43.385
He wants you.

983
01:18:43.452 --> 01:18:45.387
Get lost!

984
01:18:47.389 --> 01:18:48.624
This!

985
01:18:50.492 --> 01:18:54.196
This is a $10,000 talisman,
get the hell lost!

986
01:18:54.263 --> 01:18:56.665
A talisman is $10,000?

987
01:18:56.732 --> 01:18:58.033
From a really good shaman.

988
01:18:58.100 --> 01:19:00.769
Be gone!

989
01:19:00.836 --> 01:19:02.404
Demonic Goat!

990
01:19:07.109 --> 01:19:08.744
It must be working.

991
01:19:14.583 --> 01:19:16.318
You idiot.

992
01:19:22.157 --> 01:19:24.226
Die, jerk!

993
01:19:26.562 --> 01:19:27.996
Die! Die!

994
01:19:28.063 --> 01:19:30.599
What do we do?!

995
01:19:31.834 --> 01:19:34.803
Byung-jo, stop it! Don't do it!

996
01:19:34.870 --> 01:19:36.905
Guys, stop it!

997
01:19:42.745 --> 01:19:44.580
Stop it already!

998
01:19:47.616 --> 01:19:50.352
Sang-go! Toss him in here!

999
01:20:11.774 --> 01:20:14.876
Sang-go,
I think he's really haunted!

1000
01:20:14.943 --> 01:20:17.780
I told you we should've
done a prayer!

1001
01:20:56.618 --> 01:20:58.754
Sung-bin! Sung-bin!

1002
01:20:58.821 --> 01:20:59.922
Sung-bin!

1003
01:21:03.125 --> 01:21:04.159
Boys?

1004
01:21:34.723 --> 01:21:36.291
He has awakened.

1005
01:21:38.861 --> 01:21:42.698
Mr. Baker's drawing is mad.

1006
01:21:44.333 --> 01:21:47.436
Sang-go, let's call a shaman.

1007
01:21:47.503 --> 01:21:50.305
Let's put on a big prayer.

1008
01:21:50.873 --> 01:21:52.508
I don't think that'll be enough.

1009
01:21:53.075 --> 01:21:57.079
Gents, I think it's best
that we get out of here.

1010
01:22:10.993 --> 01:22:12.327
Who are you?

1011
01:22:15.164 --> 01:22:18.133
There are two of you this time?
You vile beasts!

1012
01:22:20.536 --> 01:22:22.971
Release the girl at once!

1013
01:22:23.038 --> 01:22:24.038
Who are you?

1014
01:22:30.546 --> 01:22:33.649
Didn't it sound like
something came out?

1015
01:22:35.050 --> 01:22:36.050
Look over there!

1016
01:22:45.894 --> 01:22:47.596
It's Mi-na's friend, right?

1017
01:22:48.797 --> 01:22:50.265
Sung-bin?

1018
01:22:55.204 --> 01:22:56.939
Yohan...

1019
01:22:58.440 --> 01:22:59.508
Baphomet...

1020
01:23:00.776 --> 01:23:02.811
Return to where you came from.

1021
01:23:02.878 --> 01:23:05.214
Lord has not granted you
a place on earth!

1022
01:23:07.950 --> 01:23:09.718
Shut up!

1023
01:23:36.378 --> 01:23:37.378
My pants...

1024
01:23:39.414 --> 01:23:41.149
I'm sorry, Captain...

1025
01:23:44.353 --> 01:23:45.521
So sorry...

1026
01:23:47.322 --> 01:23:49.124
In the name of Jesus Christ,

1027
01:23:49.191 --> 01:23:50.826
and of Jesus' mother Mary...

1028
01:23:51.260 --> 01:23:52.027
Stop it!

1029
01:23:52.094 --> 01:23:53.728
Allow us to defend ourselves

1030
01:23:53.795 --> 01:23:54.663
from Satan's temptation
and tricks.

1031
01:23:54.730 --> 01:23:57.232
Evil beings will flee
in our presence,

1032
01:23:57.299 --> 01:23:59.268
and Baphomet will disappear
from this land!

1033
01:24:04.206 --> 01:24:07.543
Give up and return to hell,
Baphomet!

1034
01:24:08.510 --> 01:24:10.512
He must be no ordinary grandpa.

1035
01:24:19.021 --> 01:24:24.393
Growing older has not
made you wiser.

1036
01:24:30.465 --> 01:24:33.835
Salt circle comes first

1037
01:24:33.902 --> 01:24:36.972
in exorcism, Yohan.

1038
01:24:39.174 --> 01:24:40.174
Excuse me...

1039
01:24:42.411 --> 01:24:44.212
Father! Father!

1040
01:24:45.714 --> 01:24:48.517
How are you?
Fine, thank you, and you?

1041
01:24:48.584 --> 01:24:49.518
What?

1042
01:24:49.585 --> 01:24:51.052
I am a boy, you are a girl?

1043
01:24:51.119 --> 01:24:52.888
That prick...

1044
01:24:53.388 --> 01:24:58.260
I'll burn you all in hellish fire!

1045
01:25:01.697 --> 01:25:02.998
- Bro.
- Yeah?

1046
01:25:12.708 --> 01:25:16.678
You should die in hellish fire.

1047
01:25:22.250 --> 01:25:26.454
Fire! Captain, I'm so sorry!

1048
01:25:26.521 --> 01:25:29.191
Hurry, go! Go!

1049
01:25:34.696 --> 01:25:36.465
Watch his head.

1050
01:25:39.234 --> 01:25:41.136
- Father, are you okay?
- You okay, old man?

1051
01:25:41.203 --> 01:25:43.372
Bro, look over there.

1052
01:25:52.714 --> 01:25:55.951
My children, rise up!

1053
01:26:17.339 --> 01:26:18.339
What's going on?

1054
01:26:18.774 --> 01:26:21.443
Captain... How...

1055
01:26:31.820 --> 01:26:35.323
Sang-go, bodies reanimated...

1056
01:26:35.824 --> 01:26:39.127
Bro, we could all die.

1057
01:26:39.194 --> 01:26:40.362
We should run.

1058
01:26:48.837 --> 01:26:49.871
Sang-go.

1059
01:26:50.205 --> 01:26:52.240
I'll take on those guys,

1060
01:26:53.275 --> 01:26:55.477
take Mi-na and the old man
out of here.

1061
01:26:56.378 --> 01:26:59.014
In the end, this is all my fault.

1062
01:27:01.016 --> 01:27:03.852
It was my idea to
live a rustic life,

1063
01:27:05.320 --> 01:27:06.722
and I lured you...

1064
01:27:09.191 --> 01:27:11.026
and poured our savings
into this house...

1065
01:27:13.795 --> 01:27:16.898
without knowing it was haunted...

1066
01:27:19.334 --> 01:27:23.371
I want you to survive this,

1067
01:27:26.241 --> 01:27:27.309
and live a happy

1068
01:27:29.611 --> 01:27:31.379
and fulfilling life...

1069
01:27:34.082 --> 01:27:35.082
Got it?

1070
01:27:36.351 --> 01:27:37.686
Where did he go?

1071
01:27:37.753 --> 01:27:40.322
Bro! Why aren't you coming?

1072
01:27:40.922 --> 01:27:42.590
That jerk...

1073
01:27:42.657 --> 01:27:44.459
Behind you! Watch out!

1074
01:27:44.526 --> 01:27:45.526
Jae-pil, watch out!

1075
01:27:47.262 --> 01:27:52.167
You evil pricks!
Get out of my home!

1076
01:27:57.739 --> 01:27:58.907
Bro!

1077
01:28:00.442 --> 01:28:01.710
Sang-go!

1078
01:28:04.713 --> 01:28:05.713
Mi-na...

1079
01:28:08.216 --> 01:28:11.186
Thank you for being my friend...

1080
01:28:15.290 --> 01:28:16.290
Sang-go...

1081
01:28:19.861 --> 01:28:20.861
Bro!

1082
01:28:23.732 --> 01:28:24.732
Sang-go!

1083
01:28:28.470 --> 01:28:29.471
Hang in there!

1084
01:28:30.705 --> 01:28:32.574
Sang-go! I'm so dead!

1085
01:28:33.408 --> 01:28:34.408
Dude!

1086
01:28:40.615 --> 01:28:42.184
Sang-go!

1087
01:28:54.162 --> 01:28:55.263
Gun...

1088
01:28:56.164 --> 01:28:58.567
You have to find
Father Baker's gun...

1089
01:28:59.334 --> 01:29:00.335
What?

1090
01:29:01.069 --> 01:29:02.704
It has a silver bullet...

1091
01:29:03.438 --> 01:29:05.974
Only that can destroy the devil...

1092
