1097
01:30:00.695 --> 01:30:08.695
Right, even if I go to hell,
I won't be lonely with you.

1098
01:30:11.306 --> 01:30:12.306
Is that right?

1099
01:30:17.846 --> 01:30:20.849
Sang-go, he's coming.

1100
01:30:29.024 --> 01:30:32.560
